This allocates new_alloc blocks, each of size sizeof(union mt_ptr)+sizeof(mrb_sym). However, the original memory layout seems to be a contiguous block of union mt_ptr[alloc] followed by mrb_sym[alloc], but here, the new allocation is interleaving them per entry, which may not match the original layout. When copying old entries, keys are accessed as:
